{
  "slug": "botsee-skill",
  "name": "Botsee Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "BotSee is an API-first tool for workflows and pipelines that automatically track and improve AI visibility. Monitor how your brand appears across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, and Grok including mentions, citations, competitor presence, and share-of-voice trends. Run analyses on demand, detect visibility shifts early, and trigger downstream actions in your stack, including content creation workflows based on real citation and keyword data. Built for teams and agents that want reliable ...",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `ai-visibility-audit` (Audit and optimize a website's AI search visibility using BotSee analysis data), `botsee` (Monitor your brand's AI visibility via BotSee API).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install botsee-skill@claude-community` from `RivalSee/botsee-skill`.",
